  "player_hint_1_en": "Suppose Bella were at row 4, column 4: then Desmond would have nowhere left to go. So Bella can't be there. So Bella (B) must be at row 4, column 5. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_2_en": "Elliot can't be at row 1, column 1; row 1, column 3; row 3, column 1; ...: in each case Cedric would have nowhere left to go. Elliot can't be at row 1, column 4; row 2, column 4; row 3, column 4: in each case Desmond would have nowhere left to go. Testing the remaining squares the same way rules out a few more. So Elliot (E) must be at row 8, column 7. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_3_en": "Fiona can't be at row 2, column 1; row 2, column 3: in each case Cedric would have nowhere left to go. Suppose Fiona were at row 6, column 6: then Desmond would have nowhere left to go. So Fiona can't be there. So Fiona (F) must be at row 1, column 2. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_4_en": "Desmond is now the only person who can still go in row 6. So Desmond (D) must be at row 6, column 4. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_5_en": "Cedric is now the only person who can still go in row 5. So Cedric (C) must be at row 5, column 8. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_6_en": "Using Cedric's clue (\"He was exactly two columns east of Gloria.\"), some squares are ruled out for Gloria. So Gloria (G) must be at row 2, column 6. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_7_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Victor. So Victor (the victim) must be at row 7, column 3. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_8_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Alma that fits her clue (\"She was in the Lawn, but not beside the table.\"). So Alma (A) must be at row 3, column 1. Cross out her row and column. Desmond is the only person in the Greenhouse with Victor, so Desmond is the murderer!"
 },
